Ultra Strict Subdomain Takeover Scanner
Focused on minimizing false positives.

Features:
- DNS validation
- Dead target verification
- HTTP fingerprinting
- SSL checks
- False positive filtering
- Claimability validation
- Multi-threaded scanning
- JSON export
- Colored output
"""

